# PyCache files
__pycache__/
cutlass_library.egg-info/
cutlass_sycl.egg-info/
/build*

# Credentials / secret files. The cutlass-jira and cutlass-confluence-wiki
# skills (and any future skill that talks to an authenticated service) read
# from ~/.cred, which lives outside the repo. These patterns are belt-and-
# suspenders — nothing matching them should ever land in a commit.
.cred
*.cred
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
